WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.499
Role gives the assistant a point of view.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.999
The task names the handoff and its reader.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.499
Context supplies the verified owner and time.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.999
